{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vb6CuHbl_jToLxPLZjgr2g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:03.827273+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vb6CuHbl_jToLxPLZjgr2g","html":"<div><section><section><p><span><span><img alt=\"文章开头+封面图.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/von6Fk7hnoLibZe89QepjjGzaLuj8zqPZx3YYWZibJbc1Gib9MvcYia5qsaUlvUBsfRibhib19BODqbNuNuAt6reiaw5g/640?from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>中南大学爱尔眼科研究院是依托中南大学深厚的医学教育底蕴与爱尔眼科医院集团丰富的临床资源，由中南大学与爱尔眼科医院集团联合成立的高水平科研机构，致力于眼科医学、视光学、眼科学基础与临床研究等领域的前沿探索与创新，为眼科行业培养临床、科研、学术复合型高端人才。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>研究院汇聚了国内外顶尖的眼科专家与学者，拥有先进的科研平台与实验设施，为培</span></span><span><span>养具有国际视野、创新能力及高度社会责任感的眼科医学高层次人才提供了得天独厚的条件，在眼</span></span><span><span>科基础研究、临床转化、技术创新等方面取得了丰硕的成果。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>一</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>院系代码及招生专业代码</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、</span></span><span><span>中南大学爱尔眼科研究院代码：092。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、眼科学专业学位代码：105116。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、眼科学学术学位代码：100212。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>二</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，在校期间未受过任何纪律处分。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的2026届优秀本科毕业生，且有望取得所在学校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、具有良好的心理素质，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>三</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>即日起通过“中南大学推免生服务系统”进行网上报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名网址：https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>四</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>材料提交</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>请申请人将材料按以下顺序电子扫描为PDF文件，并以“姓名+本科院校+报考专业代码”命名后，发送至邮箱duc@aierchina.com。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>1、本人有效二代身份证件和学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、网上报名《申请表》一份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、英语水平证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、本科期间成绩单、成绩排名证明（须注明所在专业年级总人数），并由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5、本人的学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6、获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7、个人简历及个人陈述。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>五</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>材料审核及考核</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、研究院将分批次审核申请材料，先申请先审核。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2、考核选拔预计9月中上旬开展，考核资格及具体考核安排后续将通知学生本人，请保持通讯畅通。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>六</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、申请人取得正式推免资格后在教育部规定时间内登录教育部全国推免服务系统进行报名，并完成填报志愿。我院将根据学校推免录取实际情况发送复试通知，学生接受复试确认、接受待录取确认后，方可正式完成推免录取。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2、申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对在推免过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，资格无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、其他未尽事宜以“中南大学关于2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生预报名的通知”为准（https://yz.csu.edu.cn/info/1009/1438.htm）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>七</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/fNsMLeK5p5Vicu564wI3wUv463GuZsTvtia9SIm2wR5CjWsrXia94WTu9oDwwnIDZGLjibunibV4yeebBO4g4dE7GSQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、郭老师：13617319750，微信 hag201409；廖老师：15388960255(微信同号)。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2、添加微信时请备注“姓名+本科院校+手机号码”。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"文章最后.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/von6Fk7hnoLibZe89QepjjGzaLuj8zqPZjR3Cxic5UppZgGnyzCBicPXAyVsyfkmibAaz1mFkKnGCM1YIVHaXSV1Lg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span> - END -</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"410b815fede385efb6f67848a3a74041ef25b76387108c0ca1598e75642dd69b","textLength":1317,"sourceSha256":"82077607455fd6d8cde6dd220a32495bb69c4c1eeab37b2e0f2ba684ef2c3476","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-63ca77d8029a81434176","title":"2025年中南大学爱尔眼科研究院2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:03.827273+00:00"}
